---
title: ProximaDB - DataFusion OLAP Integration (ADR-052)
---
graph TB
    subgraph "Entry Points"
        PGWIRE["pgwire SELECT\nrelational_pipeline.rs\nSQL → LogicalPlan"]
        FLIGHT["Arrow Flight\nDoGet / DoPut\nColumnar bulk transfer"]
    end

    subgraph "ComputeScheduler"
        SCHEDULER["ComputeScheduler\nroute_select()\n- P0 (Strong): always Native Volcano\n- P1+: DataFusion for\n  parquet-backed tables\n- Cost-based routing\n- caches plan→backend mapping"]
    end

    subgraph "Native Volcano (OLTP)"
        NATIVE["Native Volcano Engine\nsrc/query/execution/engine.rs\n- Row-wise execution\n- Point-lookup optimized\n- Live WAL + RecordStorage\n- Used for: P0 queries,\n  non-materialized tables,\n  Strong freshness reads"]
    end

    subgraph "DataFusion Backend (OLAP)"
        DF_SESSION["DataFusion Session\n- SessionContext per query\n- CatalogProvider + TableProvider\n- PhysicalOptimizer pass\n- Configurable memory pool"]
        DF_CATALOG["ProximaCatalogProvider\n- Lists schemas from ProximaDB catalog\n- Resolves table names → TableProvider\n- Schema-level multi-tenancy"]
        DF_TABLE_PROV["ProximaTableProvider\n- Implements TableProvider trait\n- scan(): returns PaxScanExec plan\n- statistics(): row count, size\n- Supports filter pushdown"]
        DF_SCAN_EXEC["PaxScanExec\nCustom ExecutionPlan\n- Reads PAX blocks → Arrow RecordBatch\n- Zone-map + bloom filter pruning\n- Column projection\n- Concurrent segment reads\n- TD-OLAP-1: native investment"]
        DF_ICE_SCAN["IcebergParquetScan\n- ParquetExec wrapped\n- Partition pruning from manifests\n- Row-group stats filtering\n- Snapshot-based consistency"]
        DF_OPS["DataFusion Operators\n- HashAggregate\n- HashJoin\n- SortExec\n- WindowFunction\n- CoalescePartitions\n❌ NOT building native versions"]
    end

    subgraph "ADR-039 Allow-List"
        ALLOWED["Allowed DataFusion APIs\n- ExecutionPlan trait impl ✓\n- TableProvider trait impl ✓\n- PhysicalExpr for pushdown ✓\n- AggregateUDF / ScalarUDF ✓\n❌ datafusion:: outside allow-list"]
    end

    subgraph "ADR-052 Decision"
        DECISION["ADR-052 (Accepted 2026-07-04)\n- DataFusion IS the OLAP engine\n- PAX-native SCAN is the native investment\n- Do NOT build native HashAgg/HashJoin/Sort\n- Seam keeps backend swappable\n- Row-wise Volcano = OLTP floor only"]
    end

    PGWIRE --> SCHEDULER
    FLIGHT --> SCHEDULER
    SCHEDULER --> NATIVE
    SCHEDULER --> DF_SESSION
    DF_SESSION --> DF_CATALOG
    DF_SESSION --> DF_TABLE_PROV
    DF_TABLE_PROV --> DF_SCAN_EXEC
    DF_TABLE_PROV --> DF_ICE_SCAN
    DF_SCAN_EXEC --> DF_OPS
    DF_ICE_SCAN --> DF_OPS
    ALLOWED -.-> DF_SESSION
    DECISION -.-> DF_OPS

    classDef entry fill:#b3e5fc,stroke:#0288d1
    classDef sched fill:#bbdefb,stroke:#1565c0
    classDef native fill:#c8e6c9,stroke:#2e7d32
    classDef df fill:#e1bee7,stroke:#7b1fa2
    classDef ops fill:#ffcdd2,stroke:#d32f2f
    classDef meta fill:#fff9c4,stroke:#f9a825

    class PGWIRE,FLIGHT entry
    class SCHEDULER sched
    class NATIVE native
    class DF_SESSION,DF_CATALOG,DF_TABLE_PROV,DF_SCAN_EXEC,DF_ICE_SCAN df
    class DF_OPS ops
    class ALLOWED,DECISION meta
